<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins steady to $2.00 lower; butts 1.00-2.00 lower; skinned hams weak to 2.00 lower; seedless bellies steady to 1.00 lower; fresh trimmings mostly 1.00 lower.</p>
